    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "tb-audit-concept",
        "moduleId": "audit-concept",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "审计的定义",
        "markdown": "审计（audit）功能把用户对数据库的所有操作自动记录下来放入审计日志（audit log）中。审计员可以利用审计日志监控数据库中的各种行为，找出非法存取数据的人、时间和内容。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "quote",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000296"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库安全性",
                "审计"
              ],
              "lineStart": 5677,
              "lineEnd": 5686,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "038d674f6d44fc2d825ee65cf9502e48437293ac2970ea5360139b2662e10d78"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-audit-events",
        "moduleId": "audit-concept",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "审计事件",
        "markdown": "审计事件通常包括：服务器事件（数据库服务器的启动、停止、配置变化）、系统权限事件（对系统权限的授予与收回）、语句事件（特定SQL语句的执行）和模式对象事件（对特定模式对象的访问）。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000297"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库安全性",
                "审计事件"
              ],
              "lineStart": 5687,
              "lineEnd": 5698,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "fa42ac7f1eb31d08d7417c0cbc3efc543b85530cc904ff1165154c59330ee82e"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-audit-limit",
        "moduleId": "audit-concept",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "warning",
        "title": "审计的性能与策略平衡",
        "markdown": "审计是一把双刃剑。开启审计会消耗系统资源并降低性能，因此需要根据安全需求与性能承受能力之间取得平衡。一般建议：\n\n- 对高度敏感的表和关键操作启用审计。\n- 避免对所有语句进行无差别审计。\n- 定期归档和清理审计日志，防止日志膨胀。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-audit-concept",
            "tb-audit-events"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-audit-function",
        "moduleId": "audit-concept",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "审计功能",
        "markdown": "审计功能主要用于：\n\n1. 威慑潜在攻击者，使其不敢轻易进行非法操作。\n2. 在发生安全事件后，提供追溯依据。\n3. 帮助数据库管理员发现系统安全策略的漏洞。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000298"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库安全性",
                "审计功能"
              ],
              "lineStart": 5699,
              "lineEnd": 5712,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "4eaca70295333adfa397cddab651aef9df4f52b0bc89cd85d01434fdcaaa871f"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-audit-statement",
        "moduleId": "audit-practice",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "AUDIT与NOAUDIT语句",
        "markdown": "设置审计使用AUDIT语句，取消审计使用NOAUDIT语句。\n\n例如，对修改SC表结构的操作进行审计：\n\n```sql\nAUDIT ALTER ON SC;\n```\n\n取消对SC表的审计：\n\n```sql\nNOAUDIT ALTER ON SC;\n```\n\n也可以对特定用户的操作进行审计，如审计用户U1对Student表的所有访问：\n\n```sql\nAUDIT SELECT, INSERT, DELETE ON Student BY U1;\n```",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000299"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库安全性",
                "AUDIT 语句和 NOAUDIT 语句"
              ],
              "lineStart": 5713,
              "lineEnd": 5736,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "5ee304f6dffe22dbd20aaf895efb62f6c81be17ec756bb591cb8beb1667dda23"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "exercise-audit-check",
        "moduleId": "check",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "审计概念检查",
        "markdown": "判断以下说法是否正确：\n\n1. 审计可以阻止用户对数据库的非法操作。\n2. AUDIT语句用于取消已设置的审计。\n3. 审计日志应长期保留且永不清理，以便随时追溯。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-audit-concept",
            "tb-audit-statement"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
